<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'">
<title>EvidenceForge X | Test Lab</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
<div class="brand">
<span class="mark">✳</span>
<div>
<strong>EVIDENCEFORGE <em>X</em></strong>
<small>INTEGRATION TEST LAB</small>
</div>
</div>
</header>

<main>

<section class="intro">
<div class="eyebrow">
ENGINE VALIDATION / SYNTHETIC DATA ONLY
</div>
<h1>
EvidenceForge X
<span>Quality Assurance Lab</span>
</h1>
<p>
Automated browser tests for case review,
timeline normalization, evidence provenance,
competing hypotheses, evidence exclusion,
and explainable investigation.
</p>
<p>
All tests run locally. No real case evidence,
network uploads, guilt assessments or
probability estimates are involved.
</p>
</section>

<section class="input">
<div class="sectionhead">
<div>
<small>01 / VALIDATION</small>
<h2>Integration Test Suite</h2>
</div>
<span class="pill">14 TESTS</span>
</div>

<div class="actions">
<button class="primary" id="runTests" type="button">
Run all 14 tests
</button>
</div>

<p id="testStatus" role="status">
Ready to start.
</p>
<div id="testResults" aria-live="polite"></div>
</section>

<footer>
<span>EvidenceForge X • Test Laboratory</span>
<span>
Local execution • Synthetic data • Human review
</span>
</footer>

</main>

<script type="module" src="self-test.mjs"></script>

</body>
</html>
